OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifter stole again within day
OL,4,Aof early release
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prolific shoplifter began reoffending
OL,7,Fat two north-west London supermarkets
OL,8,Fthe day after he was released early
OL,9,Ffrom prison, a Metropolitan Police
OL,10,Fcommander has said.
OL,12,FDet Ch Supt Luke Williams used the case
OL,13,Fin a letter to MPs and councillors in
OL,14,Fthe area to raise concerns about the
OL,15,Fgovernment's Early Release Scheme.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
