OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifter stole again within day
OL,4,Aof early release
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe letter, sent on Wednesday, said the
OL,7,Findividual had been identified as a
OL,8,Fhigh-risk offender by the probation
OL,9,Fservice but was released on 1 October
OL,10,Ffrom HMP Wandsworth. "Just one day
OL,11,Fafter his release" he was recorded on
OL,12,FCCTV stealing, Williams said.
OL,14,FThe government said the release scheme
OL,15,Fwas introduced to make space in a
OL,16,Fprison system that was "on the brink of
OL,17,Fcollapse".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
